      <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-8 col-md-offset-2">

  
    
  <h1 class="content-title text-center">FDA warns about dental problems with buprenorphine medicines dissolved in the mouth to treat opioid use disorder and pain </h1>
  
  					<p class="article-subtitle text-center">Benefits for use outweigh these risks and oral care can help </p>
	</div>

  </section>






                      </header>
                              
                                                          
                              <aside class="col-md-2" role="complementary">
