          <li><a href="/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability/drug-recalls" class="lcds-section-nav__section-link lcds-section-nav__link lcds-section-nav--side__link">Drug Recalls</a></li>
          <li><a href="/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability/drug-supply-chain-integrity" class="lcds-section-nav__section-link lcds-section-nav__link lcds-section-nav--side__link">Drug Supply Chain Integrity</a></li>
          <li><a href="/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability/multistate-outbreak-fungal-meningitis-and-other-infections" class="lcds-section-nav__section-link lcds-section-nav__link lcds-section-nav--side__link">Multistate outbreak of fungal meningitis and other infections</a></li>
    
  </ul>

</div>

